From: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rng: ele: include allocation and cache headers

The ELE RNG driver uses memalign(), free() and ARCH_DMA_MINALIGN when
CONFIG_ELE_SHARED_BUFFER is unset. Include their headers so this path
builds on i.MX95.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>
---
 drivers/rng/ele_rng.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/rng/ele_rng.c b/drivers/rng/ele_rng.c
--- a/drivers/rng/ele_rng.c
+++ b/drivers/rng/ele_rng.c
@@ -3,8 +3,10 @@
  */
 
 #include <dm.h>
+#include <malloc.h>
 #include <rng.h>
 #include <linux/kernel.h>
+#include <asm/cache.h>
 #include <asm/mach-imx/ele_api.h>
 
 U_BOOT_DRVINFO(ele_rng) = {
